<title>NETHERLANDS: HEIJMANS TO BUY WALCHERSE BOUW UNIE.</title>
<headline>HEIJMANS TO BUY WALCHERSE BOUW UNIE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction group Heijmans NV said on Thursday it was close to agreement on the acquisition of builder Walcherse Bouw Unie.</p>
<p>&quot;In the event of an agreement the transaction will take effect from January 1, 1997,&quot; Heijmans said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it would pay cash for the builder, which has annual turnover of some 52 million guilders. No takeover sums were disclosed.</p>
<p>The acquisition would make an immediate contribution to Heijmans' profits, the statement added.</p>
